+// docs/features/little.md E1, E8: OpenLittleWindow says the window it is
+// about to make is little, and the window's features take the mark while
+// they are made, before any of its views or its native window: its title
+// bar, its row and its commands are a little window's from the start. A
+// target of its own, with no dependencies, so the window's features can read
+// it without depending on the little window's code.
