+// "Show as Tab" is there too; each moves the page into the main window. In a
+// normal window the File menu is Chromium's and neither extra row shows.
+// Each row is validated by the window it would act on, as AppKit asks before
+// the menu opens, and chosen through the same action the menu sends.
