+// The little window's top (docs/features/little.md E8; the owner,
+// 2026-10-21): no title bar strip of macOS's own; one row, the main window's
+// address row, with the traffic lights inline at its left, Back, Forward and
+// Reload, the main window's field, and "Open in Stedding" at its right end,
+// on the page's own colour; and every empty part of it is the window's title
+// bar, which moves the window when dragged and zooms it when double-clicked.
+// E9: it is light or dark as the main window is, and follows a change at
+// once; Dark Pages darkens its page.
+
